{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:02f1e9d09cfa0a88","name":"Scout Trooper Battalion","source":{"id":"source:reference-02f1e9d09cfa0a88","title":"Scout Trooper Battalion","revision":22688,"timestamp":"2024-09-06T16:53:33Z","sha256":"1a0878ecddd92c139c35c624cbe70f6798bbc095b666ac313377a1ffa3866234","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22688","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Scout%20Trooper%20Battalion&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-02f1e9d09cfa0a88","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referenceId":"reference:45bef1c82bffe9c1"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Preceded by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Scout Troopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Scout_Troopers"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},", Scout Troopers provide excellent long-range fire for their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtrooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtrooper","referenceId":"reference:9d7164e03c073efe"}," counterparts. Scout Troopers could be found aboard Darth Vader's personal fleet, Death Squadron. One of the Scout Troopers' priorities were to aid the Sith Lord in squashing out ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"}," along with its sympathizers and secret allies.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Scout Troopers notably protected the SLD-26 planetary shield generator (which protected the construction of the Death Star II over ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Forest Moon of Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Forest_Moon_of_Endor","referenceId":"reference:471e59051dda87f2"},"), since the remoteness of the shield bunker necessitated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"}," and the thick forest environment demanded quick reflexes to traverse the landscape at high speeds.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["The Legacy Era"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Though not a trait exclusive to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referenceId":"reference:45bef1c82bffe9c1"},", Stormtroopers in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Legacy Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Legacy_Era"}," can be of any number of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},", and the Empire recruits both male and female troopers. This new breed of Stormtroopers, hailing from hundreds of different worlds throughout the Empire, seems to be more common in Roan Fel's Empire-in-Exile than in Darth Krayt's Empire, but only because the Fel dynasty has gone out of its way to draw members of other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," into the Empire's ranks. As a result, the Stormtrooper Corps of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referen